---
import MockFrame from './MockFrame.astro';
// Same widget as ChatMock's home-page hero, a different moment: a general
// catalogue question (product_search), not a single-item lookup — so the
// reply legitimately covers more than one Product{id,title,url}. No inline
// product card, no image, no stock count of 3 or more shown as a number,
// and no Add-to-cart button: none of that exists in the shipped widget
// (the chat UI's own Product type is only {id, title, url}).
// The waiting state is typing dots with no text: the widget appends an empty
//   loading indicator (assets/newChatv6.js:508-518). Its "Remote is typing"
//   line is a toast for a second message sent too early, not this state.
// The two product lines paraphrase product_search's tool result — the
//   backend, logics/shop_tools/product_search.py ("considered": up to
//   several {id, title, url} entries; the model composes the reply prose).
//   The "Stock: …" wording borrows the literal threshold rule from a
//   neighbouring tool: exact count only under 3 units, else the word "in
//   stock", never a number — the backend,
//   logics/shop_tools/get_product_status.py.
// "Highlight 2 considered products" — the widget,
//   assets/newChatv6.js:840-849 (onProductConsidered). The shipped code
//   also has a "recommanded" (sic) variant for suggested products
//   elsewhere; deliberately not reproduced here.
// Input placeholder "How can I help you?" — the widget,
//   assets/newChatv6.js:1058
// Source: local_pm/research/2026-09-24-shopmgr-ui-walkthrough.md, "2. A shopper asks…".
---
<MockFrame title="Shopmgr — Store A" meta="Live">
  <div class="space-y-2.5">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-1">
      <p class="mock-step max-w-[78%] rounded-2xl rounded-br-sm bg-action px-3 py-2 text-[12px] leading-snug text-on-action" style="--step: 0">
        Do you have any linen shirts in stock?
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mock-step flex justify-start" style="--step: 1">
      <div class="max-w-[85%] space-y-1 rounded-2xl rounded-bl-sm border border-line bg-surface px-3 py-2 text-[12px] leading-snug text-fg">
        <div class="grid">
          <span class="mock-before col-start-1 row-start-1 text-fg-subtle" style="--swap: 2"><span aria-hidden="true">• • •</span></span>
          <span class="mock-step col-start-1 row-start-1 tabular-nums" style="--step: 2">— Linen Shirt&nbsp; Price: 68.00&nbsp; Stock: in stock</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mock-step tabular-nums text-fg" style="--step: 3">— Poplin Shirt&nbsp; Price: 72.00&nbsp; Stock: 2</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="mock-step pl-1 text-[10.5px] font-medium text-action" style="--step: 4">Highlight 2 considered products</p>

    <div class="mock-step flex items-center rounded-full border border-line bg-surface px-3 py-1.5 text-[10.5px] text-fg-subtle" style="--step: 5">
      How can I help you?
    </div>
  </div>
</MockFrame>
